  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "1 cup powdered sugar",
    "1 large egg",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "0.75 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "sanding sugar",
    "0.25 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "2 ounces semi-sweet chocolate, chopped"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Position racks in the upper and lower thirds of oven. Line 2 baking sheets with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar at medium speed with an electric mixer until fluffy, about 4 minutes. Add egg and vanilla, beating until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cFXrbwMEUSdIw4yZw3LcSafYjMI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508153-chocolate-thumbprint-cookies-ddmfs-step-1-0994-4x3-503230a6b2cd4080b9c4299ea3111e56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508153/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk together flour, cocoa, salt, and cinnamon in a medium bowl until combined. With mixer on low speed, gradually add flour mixture to butter mixture, beating until well combined, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KUO_JKkD0cWyLH6FUoN9E-8WdLQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508153-chocolate-thumbprint-cookies-ddmfs-step-3-1002-4x3-cd8d36bab85344e499add83b7a28bc6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508153/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into 1 1/4-inch balls, then roll balls in sanding sugar. Place on the prepared baking sheets, spacing 2 inches apart. Press the center of each ball with your thumb (about 1/2-inch deep and 1/2-inch wide).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e2JgkZjKZWSJJNphjh171oazin4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508153-chocolate-thumbprint-cookies-ddmfs-step-4-1005-4x3-daedf9e185e54bf6993daf7a572b00ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508153/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven in upper and lower thirds, 2 baking sheets at a time, rotating top to bottom and bottom to top halfway through, until cookies are set and almost firm, 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool on baking sheets, about 15 minutes. When cool, press the center of each ball with your thumb again—the indentations will have puffed in the oven.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_k9aZ-OaP6mpEgbl3pehVxIb8fs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508153-chocolate-thumbprint-cookies-ddmfs-step-5-0983-4x3-80ed5914e2364355b93d3b9ac2a713f3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508153/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat cream in a small microwavable bowl on HIGH until just steaming, about 45 seconds. Remove from the heat, and add chopped chocolate. Let the mixture sit, undisturbed, for 2 minutes. Stir until melted and smooth. Let cool until slightly thickened, about 5 minutes. Place about 1 teaspoon filling in the center of each cookie. Slide the cookies into the refrigerator for about 10 minutes to set the filling. The cookies will keep for about 5 days in an airtight container at room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YqStTrTmsE1q5lKD1WFGeWnhCFQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8508153-chocolate-thumbprint-cookies-ddmfs-step-7-0990-4x3-264285a45f9141b285f4f577e89c3c1a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8508153/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
